    {
      "duration_ms": 12000,
      "caption": "Thompson construction builds an NFA from a regex using epsilon transitions for choice and loops.",
      "narration": "Thompson's construction builds an NFA piece by piece: concatenation chains fragments, alternation splits with epsilon edges, and a star adds a loop. Here, a then b or c, starred.",
